{"id":"wcce-c4275a444176","title":"关于做好我院2026年研究生学业奖学金评选工作的通知","date":"2026-09-14","source":"wcce","source_name":"水利与土木工程学院","channel":"通知公告","url":"https://wcce.scau.edu.cn/2026/0914/c4275a444176/page.htm","summary":"各研究生： 根据学校《关于开展我校 2026 年研究生学业奖学金评选工作的通知》、《水利与土木工程学院研究生奖助学金评选办法》等通知和文件精神，现就做好我院 2026 年研究生学业奖学金评选工作安排如下： 一、参评对象 规定学制期内的全日制在读研究生（外国留学生除外）。 二、评选指标 各年级各奖项评选指标待定，等学校后续通知。 三、评选要求 评选要求及申请材…","content_html":"<div class=\"wp_articlecontent\"><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>各研究生：</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>根据学校《关于开展我校</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>年研究生学业奖学金评选工作的通知》、《水利与土木工程学院研究生奖助学金评选办法》等通知和文件精神，现就做好我院</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>年研究生学业奖学金评选工作安排如下：</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>一、参评对象</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>规定学制期内的全日制在读研究生（外国留学生除外）。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>二、评选指标</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>各年级各奖项评选指标待定，等学校后续通知。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>三、评选要求</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>评选要求及申请材料详见《水利与土木工程学院研究生奖助学金评选办法》。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>四、评选架构</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>（一）学院研究生学业奖学金评审工作小组</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>组长：叶晖有、齐龙</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>副组长：黄慧娟、张巍</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>组员：韦未、叶可可、何春保、张丹、张轩国</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>（二）学院研究生学业奖学金初评工作小组</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>组长：张丹</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>副组长：陈继敏、陈籽伊、张轩国</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>组员：任绍杰、蒋旭、苏浩、张昉忻、蒋雨彤、陈奕丽</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>五、评选流程</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><a name=\"_GoBack\"></a><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>）学生申请。学生本人于</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>9</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>月</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>19</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>日晚上</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>20</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>时前</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>将评选</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>材料</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>电子版</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>打包发送各班长，命名格式：“学号</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>+</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>姓名”；</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>纸质版材料请务必按照相关要求填写信息、签字后，和电子版材料同时提交至班长处</strong></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>）班长收齐整理。各班长于</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>9</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>月</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>20</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>日中午</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>12</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>点前</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>将本班评选材料电子版打包发送至邮箱</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>2306555095@qq.com</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>，命名格式：“年级</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>+</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>研究生学业奖”；纸质版材料同步提交至学院院楼</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>215</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>办公室张老师处。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>）学院初审。学院根据学校下达的评选名额进行初评、公示，并报送学校。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>六、相关说明</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>（一）根据学校规定，超出学校规定学制期限的研究生（即延期毕业的研究生），不具备参评资格。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>（二）各学生评选材料包括附件</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>《水利与土木工程学院研究生学业奖学金评选申请表》以及附件</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>《水利与土木工程学院研究生奖助学金评选办法》中规定的佐证材料</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>（学术成果、获奖证书等）</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>（三）所有评选材料需要按时提交，逾期提交的视为无效。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>水利与土木工程学院</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>14</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://wcce.scau.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_doc.gif\"/><a href=\"https://wcce.scau.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/49/87/b26ef2914b76b70459f4dedd5523/f46a9c8d-691f-41a8-83bb-d1d87c5fa0a5.docx\">附件1：水利与土木工程学院研究生学业奖学金评选申请表.docx</a><br/></p><p><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://wcce.scau.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_pdf.gif\"/><a href=\"https://wcce.scau.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/49/87/b26ef2914b76b70459f4dedd5523/253ab270-6c19-4192-8874-b3150a9c8802.pdf\">附件2：水利与土木工程学院研究生奖助学金评选办法.pdf</a></p></div>","content_text":"各研究生：\n根据学校《关于开展我校\n2026\n年研究生学业奖学金评选工作的通知》、《水利与土木工程学院研究生奖助学金评选办法》等通知和文件精神，现就做好我院\n2026\n年研究生学业奖学金评选工作安排如下：\n一、参评对象\n规定学制期内的全日制在读研究生（外国留学生除外）。\n二、评选指标\n各年级各奖项评选指标待定，等学校后续通知。\n三、评选要求\n评选要求及申请材料详见《水利与土木工程学院研究生奖助学金评选办法》。\n四、评选架构\n（一）学院研究生学业奖学金评审工作小组\n组长：叶晖有、齐龙\n副组长：黄慧娟、张巍\n组员：韦未、叶可可、何春保、张丹、张轩国\n（二）学院研究生学业奖学金初评工作小组\n组长：张丹\n副组长：陈继敏、陈籽伊、张轩国\n组员：任绍杰、蒋旭、苏浩、张昉忻、蒋雨彤、陈奕丽\n五、评选流程\n（\n1\n）学生申请。学生本人于\n9\n月\n19\n日晚上\n20\n时前\n将评选\n材料\n电子版\n打包发送各班长，命名格式：“学号\n+\n姓名”；\n纸质版材料请务必按照相关要求填写信息、签字后，和电子版材料同时提交至班长处\n。\n（\n2\n）班长收齐整理。各班长于\n9\n月\n20\n日中午\n12\n点前\n将本班评选材料电子版打包发送至邮箱\n2306555095@qq.com\n，命名格式：“年级\n+\n研究生学业奖”；纸质版材料同步提交至学院院楼\n215\n办公室张老师处。\n（\n3\n）学院初审。学院根据学校下达的评选名额进行初评、公示，并报送学校。\n六、相关说明\n（一）根据学校规定，超出学校规定学制期限的研究生（即延期毕业的研究生），不具备参评资格。\n（二）各学生评选材料包括附件\n1\n《水利与土木工程学院研究生学业奖学金评选申请表》以及附件\n2\n《水利与土木工程学院研究生奖助学金评选办法》中规定的佐证材料\n（学术成果、获奖证书等）\n。\n（三）所有评选材料需要按时提交，逾期提交的视为无效。\n水利与土木工程学院\n2026\n年\n9\n月\n14\n日\n附件1：水利与土木工程学院研究生学业奖学金评选申请表.docx\n附件2：水利与土木工程学院研究生奖助学金评选办法.pdf","attachments":[{"name":"附件1：水利与土木工程学院研究生学业奖学金评选申请表.docx","url":"https://wcce.scau.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/49/87/b26ef2914b76b70459f4dedd5523/f46a9c8d-691f-41a8-83bb-d1d87c5fa0a5.docx"},{"name":"附件2：水利与土木工程学院研究生奖助学金评选办法.pdf","url":"https://wcce.scau.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/49/87/b26ef2914b76b70459f4dedd5523/253ab270-6c19-4192-8874-b3150a9c8802.pdf"}],"status":"ok","crawled_at":"2026-11-08T23:28:14+08:00"}